  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/02/P1470143.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(8 fotos) Un hombre de Onda, F.P.C., de 51 a&ntilde;os, ha resultado ileso tras un espectacular accidente de tr&aacute;fico al salirse el veh&iacute;culo que conduc&iacute;a de la calzada, junto al paraje del Carmen, hacia las 14.15 horas de este martes. Las asistencias sanitarias le han atendido all&iacute; mismo y despu&eacute;s le han trasladado al centro de salud para observaci&oacute;n, mientras la Guardia Civil regulaba el tr&aacute;fico.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470133.jpg\" alt=\"p1470133\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470134.jpg\" alt=\"p1470134\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470135.jpg\" alt=\"p1470135\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470136.jpg\" alt=\"p1470136\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470137.jpg\" alt=\"p1470137\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470138.jpg\" alt=\"p1470138\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470139.jpg\" alt=\"p1470139\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentelcarme140217/p1470143.jpg\" alt=\"p1470143\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
